  "historyNote": "#8931, eff 7-6-07 (from Fis 1102.05); ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10347, eff 5-22-13; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14 (from Fis 307.04); ss by #11114, eff 6-3-16; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18); ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
